  "system": {
    "identifier": "psionics-trick-room",
    "description": "<p>You outstretch your hand and attempt to place a Genjutsu upon all creatures within range. If all creatures currently in initiative are within range, then make an Genjutsu Ability Check against a DC equal to 10 + the number of unwilling creatures being affected. If you succeed this check the initiative order is reversed for the duration. If even one creature cannot be targeted or is out of range, this jutsu’s effects are not applied.</p>",
